## Parameters

<ParamField header="Idempotency-Key" type={"string"}>
Identifies one logical mutation across retries.
</ParamField>

<ParamField path="organizationId" type={"string"} required>

</ParamField>

<ParamField path="projectId" type={"string"} required>
The project being billed.
</ParamField>


## Body

<ParamField body="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ParamField>


## Returns

**`200`** The category remains active through cancelsAt, then stops renewing. cancellationScheduled is false and cancelsAt is null when the category had no active subscription. CancelSubscriptionResponse

<ResponseField name="cancellationScheduled" type={"boolean"} required>
False when the category held no active subscription.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="cancelsAt" type={"string | null"} required>
End of the final paid period, ISO 8601.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ResponseField>

